sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Streamlit :8501
    participant A as FastAPI :8000
    participant C as CLI de entrenamiento
    participant M as MLflow :5050
    participant V as volumen mlflow_data
    participant AR as artifacts/
    participant RP as reports/
    participant D as MkDocs :8001

    S->>A: POST /predict-batch
    A->>AR: lee el modelo
    AR-->>A: modelo y metadata
    A-->>S: predicciones en orden

    S->>C: lanza train
    C->>M: registra el run
    M->>V: persiste tracking y artefactos MLflow
    C->>AR: escribe modelo, checksum y métricas
    C->>RP: escribe informes
    S->>AR: lee las métricas
    D->>RP: lee informes para publicarlos

    Note over A,M: FastAPI no se conecta a MLflow
